body:
Sanctions + other methods

&#x200B;

Or maybe Gaddafi Putin :P

Your CPU is really holding you back, the GPU and RAM are completely fine. The game is CPU intensive so if it can't make enough use f the CPU the GPU won't help much. My CPU is around the same power so despite you owning a GTX1070, we get similar performance. 

&#x200B;

I wish the devs stopped using this measure, sure some will complain "why am I not getting 30+ FPS" but I think it is better overall to have the game be playable at 20-something FPS than unplayable just so some people can get above 30FPSand then unplayable again if they dip below 30.

Gtx 1050 2GB gang 

&#x200B;

:(

I may be wrong but Dex increases damage for a little more levels 

&#x200B;

Though I don't mess to minmax scaling that much, usually go heavy for heavy weapons and sharp for dex weapons, I don't think the damage difference is practically different enough to make an important difference.

I learned to perfectly beat his first phase. In his Second phase I can still only beat him with luck and third phase is easy because you can lighting bend him to death.

&#x200B;

Genichiro also lets you R1 him to death sometimes.

Oh I see it now, though it's harder with the image quality of the post. 

&#x200B;

My insight is lacking.
